    intro: ["For an API integration interview, clarify the intended behaviour and identify where the evidence comes from. A customer report such as 'the API duplicates data' does not establish whether the source export, mapping, retry behaviour or destination handling is responsible.", "This original customer-facing case suits integration, support engineering and solutions applicants to European international teams. It tests diagnosis and communication rather than endpoint trivia. Use synthetic records during practice and protect customer credentials in a real investigation."],
    exerciseHeading: "Investigate a daily customer import",
