    tableCaption: "Integration investigation worksheet", columns: ["Question", "Why it matters"], rows: [["Which identifier is stable?", "Names may not uniquely identify a contact."],["What does a retry contain?", "The same batch may be submitted more than once."],["What happens when ID is blank?", "The intended behaviour may differ from normal updates."],["What evidence can be shared safely?", "Credentials and real personal records are unnecessary for a synthetic reproduction."]],
